                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I love this game so much.  I played back in the day a lot on my mom's old mac.  It's a great game and it's such a shame I cannot recommend this version.  It crashes so much.  Happens mostly during battles.  It makes it unplayable.  You'll be 100 turns in, when there's multiple battles per turn and it'll crash during the 3rd or 4rth one you've fought during the turn.  It's too frustrating.  Even for somebody like me, who really wants to play it.",
